  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asi@Connect - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the achievement of previous phases, the Action aims to further develop and establish a high capacity, high quality internet connectivity network for research and higher education, notably strengthening the links to less developed countries in the network to bridge the remaining digital divide. Furthermore, opportunities for national research and eduction networks (NRENs) of less developed countries to strengthen their capacity and long-term sustainability shall be offered (capacity building, collaboration, advocacy). Moreover, the action aims to boost targeted and strategic collaboration between Asian and European research communities, while also creating links between Asia@Connect and other relevant EU initiatives like Blue Raman and Copernicus.</narrative>
  </description>
